--- !u!114 &894675332
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 894675330}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<line-height=150%>\n<size=70>GAME HELP & CONTROLS</size=70>\r\n_____________________________________\r\n\r\n<size=50>Basic
    Gameplay:</size=50>\r\n- Build your tower by upgrading it with earned coins\r\n-
    Summon troops using the gacha system to defend your base\r\n- Merge troops to
    create stronger units\r\n- Destroy the enemy tower to complete the level\r\n-
    Complete all 5 levels to save the world from the Shadow King\r\n_____________________________________\r\n\r\n<size=50>Controls:</size=50>\r\n<b>Keyboard
    Shortcuts:</b>\r\n- <b>P</b> \u2013 Summon random troop (costs coins)\r\n- <b>O</b>
    or <b>SPACE</b> \u2013 Deploy selected troop to battlefield\r\n- <b>I</b> \u2013
    Upgrade your tower (increases coin generation)\r\n- <b>U</b> \u2013 Upgrade summon
    rate (better drop chances)\r\n- <b>1\u20130 / - / =</b> \u2013 Quick select inventory
    slots (1-12)\r\n- <b>M</b> \u2013 Merge troops (requires 3 of same type)\r\n-
    <b>F</b> \u2013 Toggle fast forward (2x speed)\r\n- <b>ESC</b> \u2013 Open/close
    settings menu\r\n\r\n<b>Mouse Controls:</b>\r\n- Left Click \u2013 Interact with
    buttons and UI\r\n- Hover \u2013 View troop stats and information\r\n_____________________________________\r\n\r\n<size=50>Gacha
    & Summon System:</size=50>\r\n- Press <b>P</b> or click <b>Summon</b> to roll
    for troops\r\n- Cost increases with each summon (resets per level)\r\n- Drop
    rates improve as you upgrade summon system\r\n- <b>Upgrade Summon Rate</b> for
    better legendary chances\r\n\r\n<b>Drop Rates (Base):</b>\r\n- Common: 78% (weak
    but plentiful)\r\n- Rare: 16% (balanced units)\r\n- Epic: 4% (powerful fighters)\r\n-
    Legendary: 2% (elite warriors)\r\n- Mythic: 0% (crafted through special combinations)\r\n_____________________________________\r\n\r\n<size=50>Troop
    System:</size=50>\r\n<b>Rarity Progression:</b>\r\nCommon \u2192 Rare \u2192
    Epic \u2192 Legendary \u2192 Mythic\r\n\r\n<b>Merging Troops:</b>\r\n- Select
    a slot with 3+ identical troops\r\n- Press <b>M</b> or click <b>Merge</b> button\r\n-
    3 troops combine into 1 higher rarity troop\r\n- Merged troops are stronger than
    individual units\r\n\r\n<b>Troop Types:</b>\r\n- <b>Melee</b> \u2013 Close-range
    fighters (high HP, short range)\r\n- <b>Ranged</b> \u2013 Long-range attackers
    (lower HP, shoots projectiles)\r\n- <b>Mythic</b> \u2013 Special units with unique
    abilities\r\n\r\n<b>Mythic Combinations:</b>\r\n- <b>Vampire</b> = Yurei Youkai
    + Shaman Orc + Second Warrior + Red Slime\r\n- <b>Samurai</b> = Gotoku Youkai
    + Warrior Orc + Third Warrior + Blue Slime\r\n- Craft these in the <b>Mythic
    Forge</b> menu\r\n_____________________________________\r\n\r\n<size=50>Economy
    & Resources:</size=50>\r\n<b>Coins:</b>\r\n- Generated automatically by your
    tower (1/sec at Lv.1)\r\n- Earned by defeating enemy troops (20 per kill)\r\n-
    Used for summoning, upgrading, and deploying\r\n\r\n<b>Gems:</b>\r\n- Dropped
    by defeated enemies (chance-based)\r\n- Boss enemies drop 50 gems guaranteed\r\n-
    Used in the Shop to permanently upgrade troops\r\n- Persist across all levels\r\n\r\n<b>Tower
    Upgrades:</b>\r\n- Level 1\u21922: 10 coins\r\n- Level 2\u21923: 25 coins (increases
    by 15 per level)\r\n- Max Level: 10\r\n- Higher levels = faster coin generation\r\n_____________________________________\r\n\r\n<size=50>Weather
    System:</size=50>\r\nAt the start of each level, spin the weather roulette:\r\n\r\n-
    <b>Sunny</b> \u2013 Normal conditions, no effects\r\n- <b>Fog</b> \u2013 Reduces
    attack range for all units (-1.5 range)\r\n- <b>Acid Rain</b> \u2013 Deals continuous
    damage to ALL troops (5 HP/sec)\r\n\r\nWeather lasts for 5 minutes (300 seconds)\r\n_____________________________________\r\n\r\n<size=50>Troop
    Stats Explained:</size=50>\r\n- <b>HP</b> \u2013 Health points (how much damage
    before death)\r\n- <b>Attack</b> \u2013 Damage dealt per hit\r\n- <b>Speed</b>
    \u2013 Movement speed across battlefield\r\n- <b>Attack Range</b> \u2013 Distance
    at which troop can attack\r\n- <b>Crit Rate</b> \u2013 % chance to deal critical
    damage\r\n- <b>Crit Damage</b> \u2013 Multiplier for critical hits (usually 2x\u20133x)\r\n_____________________________________\r\n\r\n<size=50>Strategy
    Tips:</size=50>\r\n<b>Early Game:</b>\r\n- Upgrade tower first for steady coin
    income\r\n- Don't spam summons\u2014save coins for key moments\r\n- Deploy troops
    strategically to counter enemy waves\r\n\r\n<b>Mid Game:</b>\r\n- Balance tower
    upgrades with summon rate upgrades\r\n- Start merging troops to create stronger
    units\r\n- Watch for enemy epic/legendary spawns and counter them\r\n\r\n<b>Late
    Game:</b>\r\n- Craft Mythic troops for maximum power\r\n- Use fast forward (F
    key) during safe moments\r\n- Save coins for emergency troop deployments\r\n\r\n<b>Advanced
    Tactics:</b>\r\n- Enemy spawns scale with level difficulty\r\n- Boss appears
    when enemy tower drops to 50% HP (Level 5)\r\n- Reactive balancing: Game adjusts
    drop rates based on spawns\r\n- Weather effects apply to BOTH your troops and
    enemies\r\n_____________________________________\r\n\r\n<size=50>Level Progression:</size=50>\r\n-
    <b>Level 1:</b> Forest Outpost \u2013 Tutorial stage\r\n- <b>Level 2:</b> Mountain
    Pass \u2013 Increased difficulty\r\n- <b>Level 3:</b> Desert Ruins \u2013 Harsh
    conditions\r\n- <b>Level 4:</b> Wave Fortress \u2013 Endless enemy waves\r\n-
    <b>Level 5:</b> Final Citadel \u2013 Boss battle finale\r\n\r\nComplete levels
    to unlock the next stage\r\nEarn gems to permanently upgrade troops in the Shop\r\n_____________________________________\r\n\r\n<size=50>Shop
    System:</size=50>\r\n- Access from main menu\r\n- Use gems to permanently upgrade
    troop stats\r\n- Upgrades apply to ALL future summons\r\n- Each troop can reach
    Level 5 (max)\r\n\r\n<b>Upgrade Costs (in Gems):</b>\r\n- Common: 1 \u2192 5
    \u2192 10 \u2192 20\r\n- Rare: 2 \u2192 10 \u2192 15 \u2192 20\r\n- Epic: 5 \u2192
    15 \u2192 30 \u2192 50\r\n- Legendary: 10 \u2192 30 \u2192 50 \u2192 75\r\n-
    Mythic: 20 \u2192 35 \u2192 75 \u2192 100\r\n\r\n<b>Stat Scaling Per Level:</b>\r\nEach
    level increases HP, Attack, and Speed by 20%\r\n_____________________________________\r\n\r\n<size=50>Settings
    & Options:</size=50>\r\n- Adjust master, music, and SFX volumes independently\r\n-
    View troop directory to learn about all units\r\n- Reset tutorial from main menu
    (debug options)\r\n- Save data persists automatically\r\n_____________________________________\r\n\r\n<size=50>Did
    You Know?</size=50>\r\n- The game has adaptive difficulty\u2014drop rates adjust
    based on performance\r\n- You can skip dialogue by pressing SPACE\r\n- Boss units
    are 5x larger and 4.5x stronger than normal\r\n- Weather roulette can be strategic\u2014plan
    your summons accordingly\r\n- Mythic troops cannot be obtained through normal
    summoning\r\n_____________________________________\r\n\r\n<size=40><i>Good luck,
    Summoner! May the Ancient Spirits guide you to victory!</i></size=40>"
