--- !u!114 &1789107413
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1789107412}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d9dc48b7240106e45b23263c75b71d0a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 74334183}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 1975907348}
  speakerNameText: {fileID: 1767381534}
  skipButton: {fileID: 1926190182}
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 847389023}
  typingSpeed: 0.05
  autoAdvanceDelay: 2
  levelDialogues:
  - levelNumber: 1
    startDialogueLines:
    - Welcome, young summoner! The ancient spirits have chosen you to defend our
      lands.
    - Dark forces are gathering beyond the mountains. You must use your gacha powers
      wisely.
    - Each level will test your strategic mind and summoning skills. Choose your
      troops carefully!
    - 'Remember: Common troops are numerous but weak. Rare ones are balanced. Epic
      and Legendary units are powerful but rare.'
    - The enemy tower grows stronger with each victory. Don't let them reach your
      base!
    - Good luck, summoner! The fate of our world rests in your hands.
    endDialogueLines:
    - Well done! You've defended your first outpost.
    - The enemy grows stronger, but so do you.
    - Prepare for the challenges ahead in the mountain pass.
    startSpeakerNames:
    - Ancient Spirit
    - Ancient Spirit
    - Ancient Spirit
    - Ancient Spirit
    - Ancient Spirit
    - Ancient Spirit
    endSpeakerNames:
    - Ancient Spirit
    - Ancient Spirit
    - Ancient Spirit
    startPortraits: []
    endPortraits: []
  - levelNumber: 2
    startDialogueLines:
    - The treacherous mountain pass awaits.
    - Navigate the difficult terrain and face stronger enemies.
    - Your strategic skills will be tested here.
    endDialogueLines:
    - Impressive victory in the mountains!
    - The desert ruins lie ahead with their own dangers.
    - Stay vigilant, summoner.
    startSpeakerNames:
    - Ancient Spirit
    - Ancient Spirit
    - Ancient Spirit
    endSpeakerNames:
    - Ancient Spirit
    - Ancient Spirit
    - Ancient Spirit
    startPortraits: []
    endPortraits: []
  - levelNumber: 3
    startDialogueLines:
    - The scorching desert ruins test your endurance.
    - Resources are scarce here, but opportunities abound.
    - Adapt to the harsh conditions and emerge victorious.
    endDialogueLines:
    - You've conquered the desert ruins!
    - The wave fortress presents a new challenge.
    - Survive the relentless enemy waves.
    startSpeakerNames:
    - Ancient Spirit
    - Ancient Spirit
    - Ancient Spirit
    endSpeakerNames:
    - Ancient Spirit
    - Ancient Spirit
    - Ancient Spirit
    startPortraits: []
    endPortraits: []
  - levelNumber: 4
    startDialogueLines:
    - The wave fortress unleashes enemies in relentless waves.
    - Your timing and resource management are crucial here.
    - Survive the escalating assault!
    endDialogueLines:
    - Outstanding! You've weathered the waves!
    - Now face the ultimate challenge in the enemy's stronghold.
    - The final citadel awaits your assault.
    startSpeakerNames:
    - Ancient Spirit
    - Ancient Spirit
    - Ancient Spirit
    endSpeakerNames:
    - Ancient Spirit
    - Ancient Spirit
    - Ancient Spirit
    startPortraits: []
    endPortraits: []
  - levelNumber: 5
    startDialogueLines:
    - The final citadel - the enemy's last stronghold.
    - Face their most powerful defenses and ultimate champion.
    - This battle will decide the fate of our world!
    endDialogueLines:
    - INCREDIBLE! You've conquered the final citadel!
    - Peace returns to our lands thanks to your bravery.
    - You are truly the greatest summoner our world has known.
    - Thank you for saving us all!
    startSpeakerNames:
    - Ancient Spirit
    - Ancient Spirit
    - Ancient Spirit
    endSpeakerNames:
    - Ancient Spirit
    - Ancient Spirit
    - Ancient Spirit
    - Ancient Spirit
    startPortraits: []
    endPortraits: []
